<!-- SECTION 3: WHAT IS [SERVICE] -->
<section class="content-section" id="what-section">
    <div class="content-container">
        <div class="two-column">
            <div class="column-content">
                <h2 class="section-title" id="what-is-section">What Is GSTAT Appeal Filing in Kochi</h2><div class="highlight-box" style="background:var(--blue-lighter);border-left:4px solid var(--blue);padding:20px 24px;border-radius:var(--radius-md);margin-bottom:24px;"><p style="font-weight:600;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:4px;">Definition</p><p>GSTAT - the GST Appellate Tribunal - is the statutory forum under CGST Act S.109 for appeals against GST demand orders. The Kochi bench covers all Kerala districts and Lakshadweep. Southern Kerala businesses file at the Thiruvananthapuram circuit under S.112.</p></div><p>The Kochi bench was constituted under S.O.3048(E) dated 31 July 2024, with the Thiruvananthapuram circuit and Kerala district jurisdiction notified under S.O.5063(E) dated 26 November 2024. Members were allotted via GSTAT Order No. 03/2025 dated December 2025, directed to join January 2026.</p><p>Three CGST Commissionerates (Kochi, Thiruvananthapuram, Kozhikode) and the Commissioner of Commercial Taxes (KGST) issue demand orders feeding into this bench. For Lakshadweep, UTGST applies instead of KGST. See <a href="/gstat-appeal-filing">GSTAT appeal filing services in India</a>.</p><p><strong>Key terms:</strong> <a href="/gstat-appeal-filing">GSTAT appeal filing</a> | S.112 CGST Act | KGST Act | Form APL-05 | Pre-deposit under S.112(8) | Thiruvananthapuram circuit | Kerala HC at Ernakulam</p>
            </div>
            <div class="column-image">
                <div class="illustration-placeholder" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#F4F7FB 0%,#EEF2F7 100%);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);padding:40px;text-align:center;min-height:240px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:16px;margin:32px 0;"><svg viewBox="0 0 200 140" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="width:200px;height:140px;"><rect x="60" y="110" width="80" height="10" rx="3" fill="#14365F" opacity="0.15"/><rect x="70" y="50" width="60" height="25" rx="5" fill="#14365F"/><rect x="96" y="75" width="8" height="35" rx="3" fill="#E8712C"/><circle cx="30" cy="45" r="18" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="30" cy="45" r="8" fill="#E8712C" opacity="0.2"/><text x="30" y="49" text-anchor="middle" font-size="7" fill="#14365F" font-weight="700">SPICE</text><text x="30" y="72" text-anchor="middle" font-size="6" fill="#14365F" font-weight="600">Kerala</text><circle cx="160" cy="35" r="12" fill="#E8712C" opacity="0.15"/><path d="M160 23c-4.5 0-8 3.5-8 8 0 6 8 14 8 14s8-8 8-14c0-4.5-3.5-8-8-8z" fill="#E8712C"/><circle cx="160" cy="31" r="3" fill="#fff"/><text x="160" y="56" text-anchor="middle" font-size="7" font-weight="700" fill="#14365F">Kochi</text><circle cx="175" cy="75" r="7" fill="#14365F" opacity="0.1"/><path d="M175 70c-2.5 0-4.5 2-4.5 4.5 0 3.5 4.5 7 4.5 7s4.5-3.5 4.5-7c0-2.5-2-4.5-4.5-4.5z" fill="#14365F" opacity="0.5"/><text x="175" y="88" text-anchor="middle" font-size="5.5" font-weight="600" fill="#14365F">TVM</text></svg><span class="illustration-badge" style="display:inline-block;background:var(--orange-light);color:var(--orange);padding:6px 14px;border-radius:50px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;">GSTAT Appeal Filing - Kochi Bench + Thiruvananthapuram Circuit</span></div>
